            "authority": "official",
            "synthetic": false,
            "quote": "All communications to the judicial office must be submitted by e-mail",
            "locator": "Section A"
          }
        },
        {
          "topic": "scheduling",
          "summary": "Attorneys use OnceHub for listed slots up to one hour; longer hearings go through assistant email. Coordinate parties first, file notice after reservation and promptly notify the assistant of cancellations.",
          "citation": {
            "url": "https://www.firstjudicialcircuit.org/legal-professionals/judges/david-stevens/",
            "http_status": 200,
            "retrieved_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:09.713Z",
            "sha256": "15e95ea9631979153fd2feff53cf703e3084ba860ce1ccba595b288f2264a9b1",
            "path": "runs/county-santa-rosa/2026-10-19/raw/15e95ea9631979153fd2feff53cf703e3084ba860ce1ccba595b288f2264a9b1.html",
            "text_sha256": "0748929bd316a87316a2dfaa9b7036309b5539f095a604a4433fa187bd733d89",
            "text_path": "runs/county-santa-rosa/2026-10-19/text/0748929bd316a87316a2dfaa9b7036309b5539f095a604a4433fa187bd733d89.txt",
            "authority": "official",
            "synthetic": false,
            "quote": "Hearings more than one hour should be scheduled directly with the Court",
            "locator": "Section B"
          }
        },
        {
          "topic": "appearances",
          "summary": "The profile permits in-person or remote appearances for hearings of an hour or less, but separately requires a motion for communication technology. Obtain the Zoom ID from the assistant.",
          "citation": {
            "url": "https://www.firstjudicialcircuit.org/legal-professionals/judges/david-stevens/",
            "http_status": 200,
            "retrieved_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:09.713Z",
            "sha256": "15e95ea9631979153fd2feff53cf703e3084ba860ce1ccba595b288f2264a9b1",
            "path": "runs/county-santa-rosa/2026-10-19/raw/15e95ea9631979153fd2feff53cf703e3084ba860ce1ccba595b288f2264a9b1.html",
            "text_sha256": "0748929bd316a87316a2dfaa9b7036309b5539f095a604a4433fa187bd733d89",
            "text_path": "runs/county-santa-rosa/2026-10-19/text/0748929bd316a87316a2dfaa9b7036309b5539f095a604a4433fa187bd733d89.txt",
            "authority": "official",
            "synthetic": false,
            "quote": "Requests to use communication technology for an appearance must be made by motion.",
            "locator": "Section C"
          }
        },
        {
          "topic": "orders",
          "summary": "Submit Word orders through the portal with a cover letter stating agreement or disagreement; the profile specifies ten days after hearing unless directed otherwise.",
          "citation": {
            "url": "https://www.firstjudicialcircuit.org/legal-professionals/judges/david-stevens/",
            "http_status": 200,
            "retrieved_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:09.713Z",
            "sha256": "15e95ea9631979153fd2feff53cf703e3084ba860ce1ccba595b288f2264a9b1",
